{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S05等没有分时出现的段落里，感受短词略显拥挤，部分意象切换也比较密，快速扫读不如Y轻省。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏比较轻快，句子也更口语化，第一眼容易扫完；但X用重点放大和感受小字建立了清楚的视觉层级，关键心理更容易被抓住。更重要的是，X保留了人物从害怕给对方负担、因对方没有退开而放松、逐渐渴望相互依靠，到意识到亲近无法保证永远的完整心理变化，因果比Y更充分。X的感受还细致对应了音乐中的力度、旋律、声部、悬停和消退，尤其分时出现的词能让情绪变化真正跟着音乐发生，而不只是读到几个泛泛的情绪标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "25e451b4-6853-42d3-9fed-4b7a6dd35338", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T042844712077Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:30:03.803438+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6ea140a2ca898eb089b02e3724ea2052288a1a5bd44330dc4f6ea6db0ed0bd29", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools